ive view for monitoring and analyzing safety risk metrics. By providing real-time insights into inspections, job safety analyses \\(JSAs\\), and various hazard and risk categories, it enables you to proactively identify trends, respond swiftly to emerging issues, and continuously enhance workplace safety across all organizational levels.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/employee-service-management/health-and-safety-risk-management/hs-monitoring-analyzing-safety-risk-metrics.html","release":"australia","product":"Health and Safety Risk Management","classification":"health-and-safety-risk-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Health and Safety Risk Management","Health and Safety","Employee Service Management"],"tags":["#employee-service-management","#risk","#assessment","#mitigation","#ehs","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/employee-service-management/health-and-safety-risk-management/hs-monitoring-analyzing-safety-risk-metrics.md"},
